{"id":"661050","name":"白萝卜干鱿鱼焖饭","author":"_蒍鉨变乖々","authorId":"8010238","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/661050/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"白萝卜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"干鱿鱼","amount":"适量"},{"name":"五花肉","amount":"适量"},{"name":"瘦肉","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"大米","amount":"适量"},{"name":"葱花","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"干鱿鱼剪细后清水泡发洗净。","img":"images/661050/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"五花肉洗净切薄片。","img":"images/661050/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"白萝卜去皮洗净切小块。","img":"images/661050/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"锅中热油放入五花肉煸炒出油脂。","img":"images/661050/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"放入干鱿鱼。","img":"images/661050/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"煸炒炒出香味。","img":"images/661050/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"放入白萝卜。","img":"images/661050/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"少许盐，鸡精翻炒均匀调味。","img":"images/661050/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"大米淘洗干净。","img":"images/661050/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"加入的水量要比平时煮饭少一点点。","img":"images/661050/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"将炒过的配菜铺在大米上。","img":"images/661050/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"电饭煲煮饭模式即可。","img":"images/661050/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"米饭煲好后拌匀，加入葱花即可。","img":"images/661050/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/661050/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/661050/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/661050/step_16.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：电饭煲、炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}